# el3 (2026-10-25): floors, lock priority, shadow-cascade knob and cumulative cut sets, 60 s each.
measure 120
base-a 60
floor-q0 60 queue 0
floor-all 60 queue 0;;queue 20;;queue 30;;queue 38;;queue 48;;queue 50;;queue 51;;queue 52;;queue 53
base-b 60
lockprio 60 lockprio on
cascades2 60 gpoke 213d794 2
cascades1 60 gpoke 213d794 1
base-c 60
c1-shadows 60 passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows
c2-particles 60 passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle
c3-async 60 passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps
base-d 60
c4-post-water-misc 60 passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;pass q0|Frame/Postprocessing;;pass Water;;pass q0|Frame/Deferred/Grass;;passx q0|Frame/Interior Volumes;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred wetness;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred/Tiled Decals;;passx q0|Frame/Composite depth bias;;pass q0|Frame/Terrain Deformer Depth;;passx q0|Frame/SSDO;;passx q0|Frame/Separable Scattering;;passx q0|Frame/Depth-only;;pass q0|Frame/Depth-only/
c5-instanced 60 passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;pass q0|Frame/Postprocessing;;pass Water;;pass q0|Frame/Deferred/Grass;;passx q0|Frame/Interior Volumes;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred wetness;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred/Tiled Decals;;passx q0|Frame/Composite depth bias;;pass q0|Frame/Terrain Deformer Depth;;passx q0|Frame/SSDO;;passx q0|Frame/Separable Scattering;;passx q0|Frame/Depth-only;;pass q0|Frame/Depth-only/;;kind instanced
c6-items 60 passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;pass q0|Frame/Postprocessing;;pass Water;;pass q0|Frame/Deferred/Grass;;passx q0|Frame/Interior Volumes;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred wetness;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred/Tiled Decals;;passx q0|Frame/Composite depth bias;;pass q0|Frame/Terrain Deformer Depth;;passx q0|Frame/SSDO;;passx q0|Frame/Separable Scattering;;passx q0|Frame/Depth-only;;pass q0|Frame/Depth-only/;;kind instanced;;kind instanced-b;;kind item
base-e 60
